\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. The strife is o'er, the battle done;
\par Now is the Victor's triumph won;
\par Now be the song of praise begun:
\par                                     Alleluia!
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. The powers of death have done their worst,
\par But Christ their legions hath dispersed;
\par Let shouts of holy joy outburst:
\par                                    Alleluia!
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. The three sad days have quickly sped;
\par He rises glorious from the dead;
\par All glory to our risen Head:
\par                                  Alleluia!
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Lord, by the stripes which wounded Thee,
\par From death's dread sting Thy servants free,
\par That we may live and sing to Thee:
\par                                                   Alleluia!\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b 
\par }

